From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ssv6x5x: adapt the mac80211 glue to Linux 7.3

Fix the sta link fields, bss config, tx status, platform
driver remove, NAPI/strncpy, USB embedding, module params,
PDE_DATA, beacon_get_tim, efuse and NS imports.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
